  Summary

  1. appscript-function.txt - Updated for OpenRouter API

  - Changed from Google Gemini API to OpenRouter API
    (https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions)
  - Added support for multiple free OpenRouter models:
    - meta-llama/llama-3.2-3b-instruct:free (default)
    - microsoft/phi-3-mini-128k-instruct:free
    - google/gemma-2-9b-it:free
    - mistralai/mistral-7b-instruct:free
    - qwen/qwen-2.5-7b-instruct:free
  - Uses OpenAI-compatible chat completions format with messages array
  - Added optional HTTP Referer and X-Title headers for OpenRouter tracking
  - Updated instructions for getting API key from https://openrouter.ai/keys

  2. backend/src/shared/ai/providers/apps-script.ts - Updated provider

  - Changed provider name to "Google Apps Script (OpenRouter Bridge)"
  - Updated default models to the 5 free OpenRouter models listed above### 3.
    Build Status
  - Full monorepo build passes ✅ (frontend, backend, shared)

  Next Steps for You

  1. Copy the updated appscript-function.txt content
  2. Go to https://script.google.com/ and update your existing deployment (or
     create new)
  3. Replace YOUR_OPENROUTER_API_KEY_HERE with your actual OpenRouter API key
  4. Deploy and copy the Web App URL
  5. Update your .env with the new URL as AI_APPS_SCRIPT_URL

  The backend will automatically pick up the new models and the frontend's
  /api/ai/models endpoint will now return the free OpenRouter models.

